<p>
<strong>Last Updated:</strong> September 28, 2026
</p>

<p>
Welcome to PakFreeTools. We respect your privacy and are committed to
being transparent about how information may be handled when you use our
website.
</p>

<div class="notice">
<strong>Important:</strong> Many PakFreeTools utilities are designed to
