<h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>

<p>
PakFreeTools does not require users to create an account to use the
website's basic tools.
</p>

<p>
Some tools may process information that you voluntarily enter or select,
such as text, numbers or images. Where browser-based processing is used,
the information may remain on your device rather than being sent to our
server.
</p>

<h2>2. Information You Provide</h2>

<p>
If you contact us by email, we may receive information that you choose to
provide, such as your name, email address and the contents of your message.
We use this information to respond to your request and communicate with
you about your inquiry.
</p>

<h2>3. Cookies</h2>

<p>
PakFreeTools may use cookies or similar technologies in the future for
website functionality, analytics or advertising purposes.
</p>

<p>
Third-party advertising providers may also use cookies or similar
technologies to provide and measure advertisements according to their
own policies and applicable settings.
</p>

<h2>4. Google AdSense and Advertising</h2>

<p>
PakFreeTools may display advertisements from third-party advertising
networks, including Google AdSense, if advertising is enabled on the
website.
</p>

<p>
Advertising providers may use cookies or similar technologies to
personalize, measure or improve advertising and to understand how users
interact with advertisements.
</p>

<p>
Google's advertising policies and privacy practices apply to Google's
services. Users can learn more about Google's advertising and privacy
settings through Google's official resources.
</p>

<h2>5. Third-Party Services</h2>

<p>
Some tools may rely on third-party services or APIs. For example, a QR
code generation feature may use an external service to create a QR code.
When you use such a feature, information necessary for that service to
process the request may be transmitted to the relevant third party.
</p>

<p>
Third-party services operate under their own privacy policies and terms.
We recommend reviewing the privacy policy of any third-party service you
choose to use.
</p>

<h2>6. Analytics</h2>

<p>
PakFreeTools may use analytics services in the future to understand
website traffic, improve usability and identify technical problems.
Analytics providers may collect information such as browser type,
device information, approximate location and pages visited.
</p>

